    <!-- Deleting games in no list -->
    <string name="prune_title">Delete games in no list</string>
    <string name="prune_intro">Rommancer can delete from this device the games that are in none of its lists. The ones the server lacks are sent to it before they are deleted. Saves stay. You can change it later in Settings or on the web. Turn it on?</string>
    <string name="prune_ask">Deleting games that are in no list was turned on from the server. If you keep it, %1$s games (%2$s) will be deleted. Do you want to keep this option?</string>
    <string name="prune_hold">%1$s of the %2$s games on this device (more than half) would be deleted for being in no list. A list may have been emptied. Delete them?</string>
